{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52215","headline":"颂六十二首 四十 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 四十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"业风恒泛滥，苦海涛波声。\n漂我常游浪，远离湼盘城。\n忽遇（一作「何时」）慈舟至，运我出爱瀛。\n是（一作「寔」）知高慕友（一作「施」），惩过改凡（一作「顿舍贫穷」）情。\n罪垢蒙除结，神珠啓闇冥。\n释（一作「贵」）门光丽景（一作「景丽」），俗务苦重萦（一作「贱业永休宁」）。\n冀除五昏盖，方悟六尘轻。\n自非乘宝辂，何以息焰宁（一作「志求八解脱，誓舍六尘萦。\n傥遇慈父诲，开我心中经。\n」）（见同书卷六十《惩过篇》。\n注一作者，爲同书卷七一《贫女部》之异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}